**Before submitting JOOQ repository tests, verify:**
- [ ] All JOOQ methods have at least one test verifying method execution
- [ ] All conditional branches tested (e.g., different entity types, with/without filters)
- [ ] All parameter combinations tested (null, valid, invalid)
- [ ] Edge cases tested (empty collections, boundary values)
- [ ] Pagination tested (different page numbers and sizes)
- [ ] Helper methods tested separately
- [ ] Count methods tested separately from list methods
- [ ] Date filter logic tested (with and without filters)
